<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="248">by Robert W. Strickland 11 Sep 2014</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="266">for low RI materials such as fluorite or opal</text>
